  "title": "Med Spa in Scottsdale - Aesthetics in Scottsdale | Face Lounge Aesthetics",
  "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\nAESTHETICS\n\n(480) 597-4603 \u00a0\n\nBook Now\nHOME\nTREATMENTS\nSHOP\nBOOK\nMEMBERSHIPS\nABOUT\nBLOG\nCONTACT\nHello\nGorgeous.\nWelcome to Face Lounge Aesthetics. We are a locally owned med spa in Scottsdale, AZ, located in the Edwards Professional Park II. Our boutique med spa offers a quiet and intimate setting for your aesthetic needs.\nBook Now\nTreatments.\nWelcome to Scottsdale's 5-Star Rated Med Spa\n\nRF / LASER\n\nTarget specific skin concerns, ranging from wrinkles and acne scars to pigmentation irregularities, resulting in smoother, more even-toned skin.\n\nView RF / Laser Treatments\n\nSKIN HEALTH\n\nPersonalized regimens tailored to individual skin types and concerns, including exfoliation, hydration, and application of products to promote healthy, radiant skin.\n\nView Skin Health Treatments\n\nFACIALS\n\nRevitalize your skin with our signature facial treatments, expertly designed to cleanse, nourish, and rejuvenate for a radiant complexion.\n\nView Facial Treatments\n\nPEELS\n\nExperience the transformative power of our skin peel services, formulated to gently exfoliate and renew your skin, revealing a radiant, youthful glow.\n\nView Peel Treatments\n\nCLEAR SKIN ACADEMY\n\nStruggling with Acne? Whether a teenager or an adult, our Clear Skin Academy\u00a0 program allows you to finally achieve that flawless skin and eliminate acne for good.\n\nView Face Reality Acne Program\n\nView Acne Treatments\n\nCONSULTATIONS\n\nUnlock your skin's potential with our personalized skin health consultation, tailored to address your unique concerns and goals.\n\nView Consultation Options\n\nTop Selling Treatment\n\nMORPHEUS8 has been used by celebrities like:\n\nKIM\nKARDASHIAN\n\nJANUARY\nJONES\n\nDONNA\nD'ERRICO\n\nJESSICA\nSIMPSON\n\nDiscover a younger\u00a0looking you! RF Microneedling treatments for face, neck and body with the Morpheus8! Call today for specials & book your first treatment.\n\nLearn More\n\nExfoliate. Oxygenate. Infuse. Repeat!\n\nThe Glo2Facial\u2122 is now available. Learn about this amazing, simple and relaxing treatment.\n\nAs seen in the media...\n\nLearn More\nThe Best\u00a0Facial Is Here.\n\nNow offering the Hydrinity, the industry's fastest growing skincare line. Just 2 pumps, 2X a day for visible results in as little as 2 weeks.\n\nEye Renew Complex\n\nPrelude Facial Treatment Cleanser\n\nAge Renewal Kit\n\nRestorative Kit\n\nHyacyn Active & more...\n\nOur Aesthetic Partners.\nFollow us on Instagram\n\u200b\n\n\u200b\n\n@faceloungeaz\nLoad More\nMeet Yancey.\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Welcome to Face Lounge\u00a0Aesthetics\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0med spa, located in beautiful Scottsdale. Skin care has been my passion\u00a0for over a decade. I'm looking forward to helping you have brighter, healthier and younger looking\nskin! Let's get to work!\n\nAbout Me\n\nYancey Taylor\u00a0 |\u00a0 Founder\nCLT, CLI, LE\n\nShow some love...\u00a0\n\nFace Lounge Aesthetics\n8952 E Desert Cove Ave\nSuite E202\nScottsdale, AZ 85260\n\u00a0\n\n(480) 597-4603\n\n\u200b\n\nyancey@faceloungeaz.com\n\n\u00a9 2025 Face Lounge Aesthetics. All Rights Reserved.\u00a0 Sitemap\u00a0 \u00a0Google Business\n\nGet the Skin You Deserve --Starting Today!\n\nJoin our VIP Glow List and unlock exclusive specials, skincare tips, and priority booking access.\n\n\u200b\n\nPLUS: Book your first treatment today and get a FREE add-on upgrade at your appoinment.\n\nEnter your best email for VIP access\nFirst name\nLast name\nPhone\nClaim My Glow!\nClose",
